    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyss Break</strong>\u00a0is a hardcore first-person co-op horror extraction game, where you and your team venture into dangerous parallel worlds born from the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off from outside support, you must rely on an underground residential complex and its inhabitants \u2014 scavenging and trading valuable resources, taking on contracts, and fighting for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parallel world is bound by a shared catastrophe. The locals failed to stop the threat of the Great Expansion, but you have a chance to change the fate of your own reality. You know how to enter foreign worlds \u2014 and return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Favors the Prepared</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.poster.avif?t=1740131940\" width=616 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.webm?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You have full control over how you arrange your pouches, armor plates, and support gear. Customize your weapons with attachments like suppressors, magazines, sights, and more to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Is Against You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.poster.avif?t=1740131940\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.webm?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.mp4?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The Abyss is unstable \u2014 an alien reality is about to tear you apart. Escape before it's too late. But remember, rushing blindly might attract too much attention.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stronger Together</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.poster.avif?t=1740131940\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.webm?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0d5438bbbfeb6d835f112bb7cfcab0c6.mp4?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Form a team of up to three players, combining stealth, combat, and resource gathering to withstand relentless threats.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Immersion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.poster.avif?t=1740131940\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.webm?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.mp4?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world reacts to your actions \u2014 footsteps, open doors, and missing resources won\u2019t go unnoticed. With dynamic weather, a day\u2013night cycle, and detailed environments, every mission feels unpredictable and immersive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning! We\u2019ll be revealing more details and gameplay mechanics over time. <u><strong>Add it to your Wishlist so you don\u2019t miss out!</strong></u></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Abyss Break</strong>\u00a0is a hardcore first-person co-op horror extraction game, where you and your team venture into dangerous parallel worlds born from the Abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cut off from outside support, you must rely on an underground residential complex and its inhabitants \u2014 scavenging and trading valuable resources, taking on contracts, and fighting for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each parallel world is bound by a shared catastrophe. The locals failed to stop the threat of the Great Expansion, but you have a chance to change the fate of your own reality. You know how to enter foreign worlds \u2014 and return.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Favors the Prepared</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.poster.avif?t=1740131940\" width=616 height=179 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/e214828296a605001626098b6df98383.webm?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>You have full control over how you arrange your pouches, armor plates, and support gear. Customize your weapons with attachments like suppressors, magazines, sights, and more to suit your playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Is Against You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367710/extras/4795394a1d4012158a7d8f933c6e2737.poster.avif?t=1740131940\" width=616 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared