ts/steam/apps/3367710/extras/0b50f66cad4c81fa1abaa71ca4ec4ee1.mp4?t=1740131940\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world reacts to your actions \u2014 footsteps, open doors, and missing resources won\u2019t go unnoticed. With dynamic weather, a day\u2013night cycle, and detailed environments, every mission feels unpredictable and immersive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is just the beginning! We\u2019ll be revealing more details and gameplay mechanics over time. <u><strong>Add it to your Wishlist so you don\u2019t miss out!</strong></u></p>",
